# Path of Blood (ToAU 37) with the RoV era module: the 3220 finish sets the Timer to JST midnight (1, expiring then),
# with the same local mustZone var. Stirrings of War current: the first two walks come right after the finish, before
# any zone tick, and enter no area (the Timer arm is in #era_timer_tick, with a tick first); after a JST day on, the
# area 5 plays 3136. The zone-in list is not compared: the Lua modifyInteractionEntry leaves a function-valued
# onZoneIn behind (its remove only finds table handlers), so the patched mission is in that list twice; the C#
# registers it once, and both play the same 3220.
module modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/3 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventUpdate/3131 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3131 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3220 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/5 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3136
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau PathOfBlood current
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1                  # area 3: 3131
update 3131 option=0
finish                                  # Status 1, the forced zone
tick 1000
login open
finish                                  # 3220: completed, the Timer 1
walk 80,-6,-140
walk 80,-6,-130                         # the Timer holds: nothing
walk 80,-6,-140
wait jst=1                              # the Timer expired
walk 80,-6,-130                         # 3136
finish
